ArchiveLogs=不変ログのアーカイブ
ShowAllFingerPrintsMightBeTooLong=Show all immutable logs (might be long)
ShowAllFingerPrintsErrorsMightBeTooLong=有効でない不変のログをすべて表示します（長くなる可能性があります）
DownloadBlockChain=ブロックチェーンをダウンロード
KoCheckFingerprintValidity=Immutable log entry is not valid. It means someone (a hacker?) has modified some data of this record after it was recorded, OR has erased the previous record (check that the line with previous # exists) OR has modified the checksum of the previous record.
OkCheckFingerprintValidity=Immutable log record is valid. The data on this line was not modified and the entry follows the previous one.
OkCheckFingerprintValidityButChainIsKo=Immutable log seems valid compared to previous one but the chain has been broken in a previous event.
